                        <p>5-week diagnostic, 12-week strategy, 24-week execution. Posted on the wall, kept on the calendar.</p>
                    </div>
                </div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="wtt-pillar">
                        <div class="icon"><i class="fa fa-chart-bar"/></div>
                        <h4>Outcomes, Tracked</h4>
                        <p>Every engagement closes with measurable outcome. We publish our hit rate annually.</p>
                    </div>
                </div><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                    <div class="wtt-pillar">
                        <div class="icon"><i class="fa fa-handshake-o"/></div>
                        <h4>Senior Continuity</h4>
                        <p>Same partner from kickoff to closeout. No bait-and-switch.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</template>
